rules.content:
#### 规则概述
该规则检测方法是否返回一个内部数组的引用。这种做法可能导致外部代码修改该内部数组，从而引发不可预知的错误。

##### 规则意义
返回内部数组的引用使得数组的内容可以被外部代码修改，破坏了类的封装性。这会导致数据不一致和潜在的程序错误，影响到代码的可靠性和维护性。

##### 错误示例
```java
public class Sample {
    private String[] internalArray = new String[10];

    public String[] getInternalArray() {
        return internalArray; // 返回内部数组的引用
    }
}
```

##### 正确示例
```java
public class Sample {
    private String[] internalArray = new String[10];

    public String[] getInternalArrayCopy() {
        return internalArray.clone(); // 返回数组的克隆，避免外部修改
    }
}
```

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule detects whether a method returns a reference to an internal array. Such an approach may lead to external code modifying that internal array, resulting in unpredictable errors.

##### Rule Significance
Returning a reference to an internal array allows the content of the array to be modified by external code, which breaks encapsulation of the class. This can lead to data inconsistency and potential program errors, impacting the reliability and maintainability of the code.

##### Incorrect Example
```java
public class Sample {
    private String[] internalArray = new String[10];

    public String[] getInternalArray() {
        return internalArray; // Returns a reference to the internal array
    }
}
```

##### Correct Example
```java
public class Sample {
    private String[] internalArray = new String[10];

    public String[] getInternalArrayCopy() {
        return internalArray.clone(); // Returns a clone of the array to avoid external modification
    }
}
```

