    // 相关逻辑
}
```

##### 正确示例
```java
if (myObject == null) {
    // 相关逻辑
}
if (myObject != null) {
    // 相关逻辑
}
```

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
In Java, checking null values inappropriately can lead to unexpected results, especially within conditional expressions. Generally, one should avoid comparing objects directly with null.

