#### 规则概述
在处理文件上传和存储时，建议使用Apache Commons FileItem工具类来简化IO流操作。

##### 规则意义
使用Apache Commons FileItem可以提高代码的可读性、可维护性，并减少潜在的IO异常处理的重复性代码。这种做法符合现代Java开发的最佳实践。

##### 错误示例
'''java
InputStream inputStream = new FileInputStream(new File("/path/to/file"));
byte[] buffer = new byte[1024];
int bytesRead;
while ((bytesRead = inputStream.read(buffer)) != -1) {
    // 处理读取的数据
}
inputStream.close();
'''

##### 正确示例
'''java
DiskFileItemFactory factory = new DiskFileItemFactory();
ServletFileUpload upload = new ServletFileUpload(factory);
List<FileItem> items = upload.parseRequest(request);
for (FileItem item : items) {
    if (!item.isFormField()) {
        try (InputStream inputStream = item.getInputStream()) {
            // 处理读取的数据
        }
    }
}
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
When handling file uploads and storage, it is recommended to use the Apache Commons FileItem utility class to simplify IO stream operations.

##### Rule Meaning
Using Apache Commons FileItem can enhance code readability and maintainability, while reducing the redundancy of potential IO exception handling code. This practice aligns with modern Java development best practices.

##### Error Example
'''java
InputStream inputStream = new FileInputStream(new File("/path/to/file"));
byte[] buffer = new byte[1024];
int bytesRead;
while ((bytesRead = inputStream.read(buffer)) != -1) {
    // process the read data
}
inputStream.close();
'''

##### Correct Example
'''java
DiskFileItemFactory factory = new DiskFileItemFactory();
ServletFileUpload upload = new ServletFileUpload(factory);
List<FileItem> items = upload.parseRequest(request);
for (FileItem item : items) {
    if (!item.isFormField()) {
        try (InputStream inputStream = item.getInputStream()) {
            // process the read data
        }
    }
}
'''

